  "worked_solution": "To find out the weight of soil that Annie poured, we need to calculate $\\frac{9}{7}\\times \\frac{1}{3}.$\n\nTo multiply the two numbers, we multiply the numerators, and we multiply the denominators:\n\n$$\n\\frac{9}{7}\\times \\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{9\\times 1}{7\\times 3}=\\frac{9}{21}\n$$\n\nNext, we simplify:\n\n$$\n\\frac{9}{21}=\\frac{9÷3}{21÷3}=\\frac{3}{7}\n$$\n\nSo, Annie poured $\\frac{3}{7}\\,\\text{kg}$ of soil into the pot.",
